category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libgtest-devel
sdesc: "HTML5 parsing library in pure C99 (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Gumbo is an implementation of the HTML5 parsing algorithm implemented as a
pure C99 library with no outside dependencies. It's designed to serve as a
building block for other tools and libraries such as linters, validators,
templating languages, and refactoring and analysis tools."
skip:

homepage: https://codeberg.org/gumbo-parser/gumbo-parser
license: Apache-2.0
